        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"fr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>La friction hydro-alcoolique - Comment ?</title>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" id=\"MathJax-script\" async\n  src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\">\n</script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 30px 40px;\n    color: #231f20;\n    max-width: 1600px;\n  }\n  h1 {\n    font-size: 68px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    margin: 0;\n    letter-spacing: -1px;\n  }\n  h2.comment {\n    font-size: 68px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    margin: 0 0 20px 0;\n    color: #ee7623;\n    letter-spacing: -1px;\n  }\n  .intro {\n    font-size: 26px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    color: #ee7623;\n    margin-bottom: 20px;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n  }\n  .duree {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    font-size: 26px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin-bottom: 25px;\n  }\n  .clock-icon {\n    width: 32px;\n    height: 32px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: #ee7623;\n    color: white;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    margin-right: 15px;\n    font-size: 16px;\n  }\n  .duree .value {\n    color: #ee7623;\n    margin-left: 10px;\n  }\n  .grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n    gap: 15px 25px;\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n  }\n  .cell {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    background: #f2f2f2;\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 260px;\n    position: relative;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    margin-bottom: 12px;\n  }\n  .step-num {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: -18px;\n    left: -5px;\n    background: #ee7623;\n    color: white;\n    font-size: 30px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    padding: 4px 14px;\n    line-height: 1;\n  }\n  .caption {\n    font-size: 16px;\n    line-height: 1.35;\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n  .fig-desc {\n    font-size: 14px;\n    color: #999;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .footer-band {\n    background: #ee7623;\n    color: white;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    padding: 20px 40px;\n    margin-top: 25px;\n    gap: 30px;\n  }\n  .who-logo {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 15px;\n    font-size: 26px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    line-height: 1.15;\n  }\n  .who-logo .icon {\n    width: 55px;\n    height: 55px;\n    border: 2px solid white;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    font-size: 30px;\n  }\n  .divider {\n    border-left: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.6);\n    height: 60px;\n  }\n  .sec-patients {\n    font-size: 24px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n  }\n  .sec-patients small {\n    display: block;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    font-weight: normal;\n  }\n  .save-lives {\n    font-size: 30px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    line-height: 1.2;\n  }\n  .save-lives .sub {\n    font-size: 22px;\n    font-weight: normal;\n  }\n  .disclaimer {\n    background: #b0b0b0;\n    color: white;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    text-align: center;\n    padding: 10px 60px;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n  }\n  .revision {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    color: #999;\n    margin-top: 8px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <h1>La friction hydro-alcoolique</h1>\n  <h2 class=\"comment\">Comment ?</h2>\n\n  <div class=\"intro\">\n    Utiliser la friction hydro-alcoolique pour l&rsquo;hygi&egrave;ne des mains !<br>\n    Laver vos mains au savon et &agrave; l&rsquo;eau lorsqu&rsquo;elles sont visiblement souill&eacute;es.\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"duree\">\n    <span class=\"clock-icon\">&#9201;</span>\n    Dur&eacute;e de la proc&eacute;dure : <span class=\"value\">20-30 secondes</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"grid\">\n\n    <div class=\"cell\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder\">\n        <span class=\"step-num\">1a</span>\n        <div class=\"fig-desc\">[Illustration : main recevant du produit hydro-alcoolique d&rsquo;un flacon]</div>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"caption\">Remplir la paume d&rsquo;une main avec le produit hydro-alcoolique, recouvrir toutes les surfaces des mains et frictionner :</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"cell\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder\">\n        <span class=\"step-num\">1b</span>\n        <div class=\"fig-desc\">[Illustration : main recevant du produit d&rsquo;un flacon pompe]</div>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"caption\">&nbsp;</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"cell\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder\">\n        <span class=\"step-num\">2</span>\n        <div class=\"fig-desc\">[Illustration : paume contre paume, fl&egrave;che de rotation]</div>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"caption\">Paume contre paume par mouvement de rotation ;</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"cell\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder\">\n        <span class=\"step-num\">3</span>\n        <div class=\"fig-desc\">[Illustration : dos de la main gauche frott&eacute; par paume droite, fl&egrave;ches avant-arri&egrave;re]</div>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"caption\">Le dos de la main gauche avec un mouvement d&rsquo;avant en arri&egrave;re exerc&eacute; par la paume de la main droite,  et vice versa ;</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"cell\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder\">\n        <span class=\"step-num\">4</span>\n        <div class=\"fig-desc\">[Illustration : doigts entrelac&eacute;s, croix orange]</div>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"caption\">Les espaces interdigitaux, paume contre paume et doigts entrelac&eacute;s, en exer&ccedil;ant un mouvement d&rsquo;avant en arri&egrave;re ;</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"cell\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder\">\n        <span class=\"step-num\">5</span>\n        <div class=\"fig-desc\">[Illustration : mains crois&eacute;es, fl&egrave;ches lat&eacute;rales]</div>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"caption\">Le dos des doigts dans la paume de la main oppos&eacute;e, avec un mouvement d&rsquo;aller-retour lat&eacute;ral ;</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"cell\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder\">\n        <span class=\"step-num\">6</span>\n        <div class=\"fig-desc\">[Illustration : pouce dans la main oppos&eacute;e, fl&egrave;che de rotation]</div>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"caption\">Le pouce de la main gauche par rotation dans la main droite, et vice versa ;</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"cell\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder\">\n        <span class=\"step-num\">7</span>\n        <div class=\"fig-desc\">[Illustration : pulpe des doigts dans la paume, fl&egrave;che de rotation]</div>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"caption\">La pulpe des doigts de la main droite dans la paume de la main gauche, et vice et versa ;</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"cell\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder\">\n        <span class=\"step-num\">8</span>\n        <div class=\"fig-desc\">[Illustration : deux mains ouvertes, s&egrave;ches]</div>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"caption\">Une fois s&egrave;ches, vos mains sont pr&ecirc;tes pour le soin.</p>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"footer-band\">\n    <div class=\"who-logo\">\n      <span class=\"icon\">&#9906;</span>\n      <span>Organisation<br>mondiale de la Sant&eacute;</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"divider\"></div>\n    <div class=\"sec-patients\">\n      S&eacute;curit&eacute; des patients\n      <small>Une Alliance mondiale pour des soins plus s&ucirc;rs</small>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"divider\"></div>\n    <div class=\"save-lives\">\n      SAVE LIVES\n      <div class=\"sub\">Clean <strong>Your</strong> Hands</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"disclaimer\">\n    L&rsquo;Organisation Mondiale de la Sant&eacute; (OMS) a pris toutes les dispositions n&eacute;cessaires pour v&eacute;rifier les informations contenues dans ce document. Toutefois, le document publi&eacute; est diffus&eacute; sans aucune garantie, expresse ou implicite.<br>\n    La responsabilit&eacute; de l&rsquo;interpr&eacute;tation et de l&rsquo;utilisation de ce document incombe au lecteur. En aucun cas, l&rsquo;OMS ne saurait &ecirc;tre tenue responsable des pr&eacute;judices subis du fait de son utilisation.<br>\n    L&rsquo;OMS remercie les H&ocirc;pitaux Universitaires de Gen&egrave;ve (HUG), en particulier les collaborateurs du Service de Pr&eacute;vention et Contr&ocirc;le de l&rsquo;Infection, pour leur participation active &agrave; l&rsquo;&eacute;laboration de ce mat&eacute;riel.\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"revision\">R&eacute;vision : Mai 2009</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
